  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u4ECA\u307E\u3067\u3088\u308A\u3042\u3093\u305F\u3092\u77E5\u308B\u6A5F\u4F1A\u306F\n\u78BA\u5B9F\u306B\u591A\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I\u0027ve had more chances to get to know you\nthan ever before"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D50\u679C\u3001\u30B7\u30F3\u30D7\u30EB\u306B\u3042\u3093\u305F\u306E\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u597D\u304D\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u2026\u2026\u305D\u308C\u3060\u3051\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And as a result, I\u0027ve simply grown\nto like you... That\u0027s all"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u7121\u8336\u3060\u3068\u5206\u304B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3082\n\u3042\u3093\u305F\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So even though I knew it was reckless,\nI worked hard for your sake"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u3001\u305D\u308C\u304C\u672C\u97F3\u3060\u3068\u3057\u3066\u2026\u2026\n\uFF11\u3064\u3060\u3051\u899A\u3048\u3066\u3044\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If that\u0027s truly how you feel...\nremember one thing"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u305D\u308C\u305E\u308C\u306E\u6E07\u671B\u3092\u6E80\u305F\u3059\u305F\u3081\u306B\n\u3053\u3053\u306B\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We\u0027re all here to fulfill our own desires"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3082\u3001\u3042\u304F\u307E\u3067\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u305F\u3081\u3002\n\u3060\u3051\u3069\u306D\u3001\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We\u0027re together for our own benefit.\nBut you know, Valeria..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u305D\u308C\u3068\u540C\u6642\u306B\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306E\u6E07\u671B\u304C\n\u6E80\u305F\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3082\u9858\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At the same time, I also wish for everyone\u0027s\ndesires to be fulfilled"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u305F\u3081\u3092\u60F3\u3046\u306E\u306A\u3089\u3001\n\u3082\u3046\u5C11\u3057\u81EA\u5206\u3092\u5927\u5207\u306B\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you truly care for my sake,\nthen take better care of yourself"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6E07\u671B\u3092\u6E80\u305F\u3059\u524D\u306B\n\u5012\u308C\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3063\u3066\u306F\u610F\u5473\u304C\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After all, it would be meaningless if you collapse\nbefore fulfilling your desires"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  }
